AUDIO: 'You\'ve seen this photo a hundred times. &gt;&gt; [music] &gt;&gt; But do you remember the looks on everyone\'s faces? Spin it around. Turns out there was a whole other show going on. This time, hit save on the moment. Just your phone. Circle around like you\'re'

[00:13] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'shooting video. [music] 1 minute to capture, 2 minutes to a 3D spatial photo. Nothing goes to the cloud. It all happens on your phone. [music] Free, private, no waiting. When a place is worth capturing, one angle isn\'t enough. &gt;&gt; [music]'

[00:27] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: '&gt;&gt; Save the whole scene. Next time, look from any angle you like. &gt;&gt; [music] &gt;&gt; Care like that never stops at the front. Send it around so every bit of that effort gets seen. The more you love it,'

[00:40] [scene:talk]
