AUDIO: 'the closer you look. Give it a spin. Every detail, crystal clear. The scan is only the beginning. &gt;&gt; [music] &gt;&gt; Drop it somewhere new. Nudge it. Turn it.'

[00:52] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
